// Spec §3 — 15 granular consent categories. Distinct from the existing
// ConsentRecord (registration-time privacy/matchmaking/contact/terms) and
// CommunicationConsent (per-channel email/sms/whatsapp) — both keep
// enforcing exactly what they enforce today. ConsentGrant is the new,
// append-only history ledger the Consent Center reads/writes; for the two
// categories already owned by an existing table, granting/revoking here
